preserve the old +11.7%.\n\nSo final: 内在涨幅 +33% (团队锚26.21元 vs 19.73). In the body I can mention the view's own conservative DCF as a sensitivity (range +12%~+33%), showing \"有依据\" nuance, but the headline number aligns to the team anchor.\n\n**击球区**: The three reports: 🟢 (巴菲特) / 🟡 (芒格) / 🟡 (李录). Team 综合: 🟡. 段永平 own round-2: 🟡偏🟢. \n\nFor alignment: majority + team synthesis = 🟡. I'll go **🟡** with a sentence like \"🟡 价格已入击球区边缘但生意边际向下，主仓等18.5元下方或Q3/说明会验证后再挥棒\" — and mention 偏🟢 flavor in body. Actually the format line: \"击球区: 🟢/🟡/🔴 结论一句话\". I'll write: \"- 击球区: 🟡 偏🟢——估值维度已入区（PE历史极值+内在涨幅约33%），但提价引擎熄火+专利悬崖3个月倒计时，等18.5元下方或Q3数据确认\". Hmm, \"🟡 偏🟢\" — is that violating format? The format template is \"🟢/🟡/🔴 结论一句话\" meaning the value is one of the three emojis followed by a one-sentence conclusion. \"🟡 偏🟢——...\" — the value is 🟡, sentence mentions nuance. I think acceptable. Or keep it strictly \"🟡\" + sentence. The old file had \"🟡 **合理但不便宜**——...\". I'll do: \"- 击球区: 🟡 价格已到位但证据未到——生意边际向下（提价熄火+专利悬崖），主仓等18.5元下方，激进者现价可小仓试水吃5.6%股息\".\n\nHmm wait, but should 击球区 be 🟡 or 🟢? Let me think about what \"对齐\" means here. 巴菲特 (估值视角) = 🟢 because valuation is historically cheap. 段永平 (商业模式视角) = business model marginal deterioration → more cautious. The four views having different 击球区 colors is actually the norm in this team's workflow (each view judges from its own lens). The consistency rule in the task says they \"应一致，除非有依据持不同观点\". 段永平 has basis: 提价引擎熄火、定价权降级、专利悬崖 — his view diverges from 巴菲特's 🟢 with justification, aligning with 芒格/李录's 🟡 and the team 综合 🟡. \n\nSo 击球区: 🟡 (with 偏🟢 note). This aligns with 2 of 3 other views + team synthesis. Good.\n\n**目标建仓价**: Options: 巴菲特 18.7 / 芒格 20.5 / 李录 15.5 / team 综合 18.5 / 段永平 own 18.5-19.0.\n\nAlignment: the valuation anchor is 巴菲特's 18.7 (he's the one who derives 建仓价 from intrinsic value math). Team 综合: 18.5. 段永平 own: 18.5-19.0. The consistent pick: **18.5元**? or **18.7元**?\n\nThe team-lead 综合研判 explicitly says: 综合建仓价 18.5元. And 段永平's own round