化结论 is required. Putting 免责声明 just before 量化结论 is fine and keeps the disclaimer present.\n\nAlso the report header should note the 重写 date and rationale (对齐四视角). \n\nAlso per AGENTS.md: state data cutoff date in header ✓ (2026-08-18收盘).\n\nShould I mention \"本文件于2026-08-22重写\"? The team's round happened 08-19. The rewrite is a housekeeping alignment. I'll note in header: \"重写对齐：2026-08-22（将第二轮结论对齐四视角一致口径，未引入08-19后新数据）\". Good.\n\nLet me also double check 内在涨幅 32.8% — 26.21/19.73: 19.73×1.328 = 26.20. So +32.8%. I'll say \"+33%\" in the bold and give exact 32.8% in parens. Or bold \"+32.8%\"? Cleaner: \"**+33%**（26.21÷19.73=+32.8%）\". Good.\n\nPE at 18.5: 18.5/1.3766 = 13.44 → 约13.4x ✓. 股息率 1.10/18.5 = 5.9459% → 约5.9% ✓. 折价 18.5/26.21 = 0.7058 → 约29% ✓.\nPE at 16.5: 16.5/1.3766 = 11.99 → 约12.0x ✓. 股息率 1.10/16.5 = 6.6667% → 约6.7% ✓. 折价 16.5/26.21 = 0.6295 → 约37% ✓.\n\n市值: 19.73×5.671 = 111.889... ✓ 111.89亿.\nTTM净利: 7.60−4.7433+4.95 = 7.8067 ✓ (7.60 = 2025全年归母; 4.7433 = 2025H1).\n\nPB: BVPS ≈ 5.9946 − 1.10 + 0.8729 = 5.7675; 19.73/5.7675 = 3.42 ✓.\n\nNow — one thing to double check: 巴菲特's 建仓价18.7 was \"中性目标27.92×0.67\". My 18.5 = 26.21×0.706. Consistent logic (约0.7折扣). Good, and 18.5 matches 团队综合 exactly.\n\nAlso需要 run `date` per project rules. Then write the file. Then ls. Then print RESEARCH_DONE 600285.\n\nAlso — task says the rewrite keeps 商业模式 methodology. My draft does (护城河逐项、定价权三档、三标准、反面检验 — all 段永平-style).\n\nOne more check on the task: \"3) 重写 reports/600285羚锐制药-商业模式-段永平视角.md\" — the file WITHOUT date suffix. Yes. (The dated one stays untouched.)\n\nLet me also make sure not to delete useful old content wholesale — but it's a rewrite for alignment; updating is the point. I'll preserve the methodological skeleton.\n\nRegarding 内在涨幅 justification in body section 六: I said \"本视角独立DCF口径...约+12%\". This shows the \"有依据持不同观点\" nuance while the headline aligns. Good balance.\n\nHmm, actually — wait. Let me reconsider the 内在涨幅 headline once more. Is it truly better to